secure Google's use on Google

00:03:33.690 --> 00:03:34.870
Cloud Platform.

00:03:34.870 --> 00:03:37.780
And this team had
built a set of tools

00:03:37.780 --> 00:03:40.720
that was really interesting
and that we were really looking

00:03:40.720 --> 00:03:42.670
for help to extend and expand.

00:03:42.670 --> 00:03:44.680
And we thought that the
work that we had done

00:03:44.680 --> 00:03:47.590
