to and help maintain Forseti.

00:04:27.600 --> 00:04:30.030
And we're really looking
for more people to do that.

00:04:30.030 --> 00:04:33.090
We think that contributing
lets you share your expertise

00:04:33.090 --> 00:04:37.327
and really helps the entire
ecosystem get safer across GCP.

00:04:37.327 --> 00:04:38.910
It's really been an
amazing experience

00:04:38.910 --> 00:04:41.076
to have all of us working
together to create a safer

00:04:41.076 --> 00:04:42.570
